================================================================================
SCOPE
================================================================================

The following components are licensed under the Apache License 2.0, the full
text of which is at `licenses/Apache-2.0.txt` and alongside each component:

  - packages/sdk        (@opensteward/sdk)
  - packages/cli        (@opensteward/cli)
  - apps/mcp-server     (@opensteward/mcp-server)

These are client artifacts. You can depend on them, ship them, and build against
the OpenSteward API with no restrictions beyond Apache-2.0.

Everything else in this repository — including apps/integration-server,
apps/admin, apps/admin-api, apps/webhook-gateway, apps/docs-server, and the
packages/ libraries they depend on — is licensed under the Elastic License 2.0
together with the Additional Use Grant below.


