    provided the license key functionality is not moved, changed, disabled, or
    circumvented.
  - Embedding it in a product you sell, including a SaaS product, and letting
    your customers connect their own platforms through Connect Link and read
    their data through the unified API.
  - Redistributing it, including inside commercial and closed-source software,
    and including on-premises deployments you sell to your own customers.
  - Providing consulting, deployment, hosting, or support services around an
